{"version":1,"content":"<p>英偉達行政總裁黃仁勳呼籲歐洲加快人工智能落地。在不少投資者開始質疑算力基建巨額投入回報的背景下，他對AI前景保持樂觀。這家總部位於加州聖克拉拉、晶片撐起本輪AI熱潮的企業，在本次柏林大會上面向歐洲市場，發佈了新的數據中心硬件、軟件、模型，同時公佈與當地龍頭企業的合作。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583246.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:45.109985+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T14:42:45+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:13.633892+00:00","content_hash":"208722bf666a5d938a5bab44968b71ec29b68cc3c8b99e2b5c10f360605776c9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}